di", "fr": "et il a soumis", "id": "dan dia telah menundukkan", "ur": "اور اُس نے مسخر کیا", "bn": "এবং সে বশীভূত করল", "fa": "و مسخر کرد"}}, {"text": "لَكُمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلشَّمْسَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱلْقَمَرَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "دَآئِبَيْنِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَسَخَّرَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/eb64bf074f5661318475.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "and he/it subjected", "bs": "i potčinio je", "tr": "ve boyun eğdirdi", "fr": "et il a soumis", "id": "dan dia telah menundukkan", "ur": "اور اُس نے مسخر کیا", "bn": "এবং সে বশীভূত করল", "fa": "و مسخر کرد"}}, {"text": "لَكُمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّيْلَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱلنَّهَارَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "38:18", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3988.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Lo! We subdued the hills to hymn the praises (of their Lord) with him at nightfall and sunrise,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Biz, dağları onun emrine vermiştik. Akşamsabah onunla birlikte tesbih ederlerdi.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "بیشک ہم نے اس کے ساتھ پہاڑ مسخر فرمادیے کہ تسبیح کرتے شام کو اور سورج چمکتے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Sesungguhnya Kami menundukkan gunung-gunung untuk bertasbih bersama dia (Daud) di waktu petang dan pagi,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "إِنَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سَخَّرْنَا", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/ef535332617deba657e7.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "potčinili smo", "en": "We subjected", "tr": "boyun eğdirdik", "fr": "Nous avons assujetti", "id": "Kami menundukkan", "ur": "ہم نے مسخر کیا", "bn": "আমরা অধীন করে দিয়েছি", "fa": "مسخر کردیم"}}, {"text": "ٱلْجِبَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَعَهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُسَبِّحْنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِٱلْعَشِىِّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱلْإِشْرَاقِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "وَسَخَّرَ", "count": 11, "first": "13:2", "audio": "audio/a606453bd1390dd52d70.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "and he/it subjected", "bs": "i potčinio je", "tr": "ve boyun eğdirdi", "fr": "et il a soumis", "id": "dan dia telah menundukkan", "ur": "اور اُس نے مسخر کیا", "bn": "এবং সে বশীভূত করল", "fa": "و مسخر کرد"}}, {"arabic": "سَخَّرَ", "count": 5, "first": "16:14", "audio": "audio/13ba41ac60c9ff74e4ea.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it subjected", "bs": "potčinio je", "tr": "boyun eğdirdi", "fr": "il a soumis", "id": "dia telah menundukkan", "ur": "اُس نے مسخر کیا", "bn": "সে বশীভূত করল", "fa": "مسخر کرد"}}, {"arabic": "سَخَّرَهَا", "count": 2, "first": "22:37", "audio": "audio/8e3d6602cf562231b9bf.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["hiya"]}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it subjected her/it", "bs": "potčinio ju je", "tr": "ona boyun eğdirdi", "fr": "il l'a soumise", "id": "dia telah menundukkannya", "ur": "اُس نے اسے مسخر کیا", "bn": "সে তাকে বশীভূত করল", "fa": "آن را مسخر کرد"}}, {"arabic": "وَسَخَّرْنَا", "count": 1, "first": "21:79", "audio": "audio/bb9548b1e684c40bee36.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "and we subjected", "bs": "i potčinili smo", "tr": "ve boyun eğdirdik", "fr": "et nous avons soumis", "id": "dan kami tela